one X, which starts at $1,000, the average price consumers paid for Apple's smartphones jumped through the roof in the period. As seen in this chart from Statista , which is based on Apple's data, the average price consumers are paying for iPhones has been on a steady incline — as has Apple's smartphone revenue.\nSEE ALSO: Nintendo Switch is on track to sell 20 million units in 2018& Nintendo Switch is on track to sell 20 million units in 2018\n What it's like to pretend to live on Mars for 8 months", "external_links": ["http://feeds.feedburner.com/~ff/typepad/alleyinsider/silicon_alley_insider?a=Tb_Y8h6KoYI:PavuYsnx-po:V_sGLiPBpWU", "http://feeds.feedburner.com/~ff/typepad/alleyinsider/silicon_alley_insider?a=Tb_Y8h6KoYI:PavuYsnx-po:bcOpcFrp8Mo", "http://feedproxy.google.com/~r/typepad/alleyinsider/silicon_alley_insider/~3/Tb_Y8h6KoYI/apples-iphone-revenue-jumped-in-the-fourth-quarter-charts-2018-2", "http://feeds.feedburner.com/~ff/typepad/alleyinsider/silicon_alley_insider?a=Tb_Y8h6KoYI:PavuYsnx-po:qj6IDK7rITs", "http://feeds.feedburner.com/~ff/typepad/alleyinsider/silicon_alley_insider?d=bcOpcFrp8Mo", "http://feeds.feedburner.com/~ff/typepad/alleyinsider/silicon_alley_insider?i=Tb_Y8h6KoYI:PavuYsnx-po:gIN9vFwOqvQ", "http://feeds.feedburner.com/~ff/typepad/alleyinsider/silicon_alley_insider?a=Tb_Y8h6KoYI:PavuYsnx-po:yIl2AUoC8zA", "http://feeds.feedburner.com/~ff/typepad/alleyinsider/silicon_alley_insider?a=Tb_Y8h6KoYI:PavuYsnx-po:QXVau8BzmBE", "https://www.statista.com/chart/12781/iphone-unit-sales-and-revenue/", "http://www.businessinsider.com/apple-fiscal-q1-2018-earnings-iphone-sales-revenue-eps-2018-2", "http://www.businessinsider.com/nintendo-switch-sales-on-track-for-20-million-units-2018-1", "http://feeds.feedburner.com/~ff/typepad/alleyinsider/silicon_alley_insider?a=Tb_Y8h6KoYI:PavuYsnx-po:gIN9vFwOqvQ", "http://www.businessinsider.com/apples-iphone-revenue-jumped-in-the-fourth-quarter-charts-2018-2#comments", "http://feeds.feedburner.com/~ff/typepad/alle